{
  "id": "icmp",
  "label": "ICMP",
  "rfc": ["792"],
  "notes": "ICMP over IPv4 (protocol 1). The offsets assume the 8-byte common header: Type, Code, Checksum and four type-dependent bytes. The checksum is a computed field and is not offered as a filter; the rest-of-header bytes (identifier/sequence for echo, and so on) are type-dependent and are not modelled in v1. ICMPv6 (RFC 4443) is a different protocol and is not covered by this entry. The Code field is kept as a number because its meaning depends on Type.",
